<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>8 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>7 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>6 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle), Alan Shearer (Newcastle),</p>
<p>Efan Ekoku (Wimbledon), Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>5 - Andy Booth (Sheffield Wednesday), Gianluca Vialli</p>
<p>(Chelsea), Robbie Earle (Wimbledon)</p>
<p>4-  Patrik Berger (Liverpool), Ole Solskjaer (Manchester</p>
<p>United), Eric Cantona (Manchester United), Brian Gayle</p>
<p>(Wimbledon)</p>
